{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2021-08-16 09:00:00', 'title': 'CREDERA NAMES NICKORIA JOHNSON CHIEF DIVERSITY OFFICER', 'text': 'DALLAS, AUG. 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CREDERA, A GLOBAL BOUTIQUE CONSULTING FIRM FOCUSED ON STRATEGY, TRANSFORMATION, DATA, AND TECHNOLOGY, HAS NAMED NICKORIA JOHNSON TO THE NEWLY CREATED POSITION OF CHIEF DIVERSITY OFFICER. JOHNSON WILL BE RESPONSIBLE FOR ACCELERATING THE MISSION OF AMPLIFYING VOICES OF UNDERREPRESENTED GROUPS AND SYNERGIZING DIVERSITY, EQUITY, AND INCLUSION (DE&I) EFFORTS TOWARD UNIFIED GOALS TO ENSURE ACCESSIBILITY, FOCUS, AND VISIBILITY OF DE&I FOR THE FIRM.'}